{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっほい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわ。\nろってぃーです*^^*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/%E3%81%BE%E3%81%B2%E3%82%8D%EF%BC%96.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は新しい曲の\nレコーディング★を\nしてきました´∇`"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこよく歌えてたかなぁぁ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配だ。♪にっ,"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日のね  火曜日,\n１人で原宿に行ったらね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽し過ぎて ずーーっと\n歩いて歩いて\nあきなくて結局同じ道\n3ループもしちゃった☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほなら,雨降ってきて\n周りの人 傘さしてたけど\nまひろ持ってきてなかったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頭に 買い物袋のっけて\n5分位歩いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのまま喫茶店に\n雨宿りしに行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほいなら  せちゃんに\n会いたくなちゃって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せちゃんも会いたい。\nって言ってくれたので\n夕方にせちゃんも原宿に\n来ることになって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"駅で待ち合わせしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当めちゃくちゃ\n楽しかった*´ω`*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時の写メ★☆★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/05/5547677/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも その日\n初めて顔合わせる時"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこよく\n『ろてぃーーー!!☆』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくれます♪"},